"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([[13264],{81457:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"functions":[],"properties":[],"types":[],"name":"AutoCannonServer","desc":"Authority for the train-mounted AutoCannon (four barrels, hold to fire).\\nThe shared turret core (`TrainTurretServer`) discovers placed turrets in\\nworkspace.PlacedObjects, seats the gunner after validation (and ejects anyone\\nit did not seat) and steps the yaw/pitch toward the gunner\'s aim reports at\\nthe turn-rate limit. This script is the weapon on top of it: the magazine and\\nreload, and FastCast2 spherecast shells fired from the turret\'s own rig math.\\nA proximity fuse and a direct hit both give the target full damage\\n(`TrainWeaponDamage.applyDirect`) before the splash (`applyBlast`). State is\\npublished as attributes on the placed Model: AimYaw, AimPitch, Ammo, Reloading,\\nReloadEndsAt, GunnerUserId, plus the HUD contract DisplayName, MagazineSize,\\nReloadTime (read by the generic TurretGui).\\n\\nWith no gunner for `CannonConfig.AutoLoaderIdleTime` and a Smart Cannon /\\nOrbital Sentinel holder in the party, the turret aims at the nearest visible\\nenemy itself and fires at `FireRate x AutoLoaderRate`, credited to the holder.","realm":["Server"],"source":{"line":22,"path":"src/ServerScriptService/AutoCannonServer.server.luau"}}')}}]);